---
// AboutCollab.astro
---

<section id="about" class="py-12 sm:py-16 px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto space-y-6">
    <!-- Section Header -->
    <div class="text-center max-w-2xl mx-auto mb-4" data-reveal>
      <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 font-mono text-xs text-nx-cyan tracking-widest uppercase mb-1.5">
        <span class="size-1.5 rounded-full bg-nx-cyan"></span>
        <span>// TENTANG KOLABORASI //</span>
      </div>
      <h2 class="font-display font-extrabold text-2xl sm:text-4xl text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-2">
        Sinergi <span class="text-nf-orange-bright">NFCTF</span> <span class="text-nx-purple font-mono">✕</span> <span class="text-nx-cyan">NXCTF</span>
      </h2>
      <p class="text-xs sm:text-sm text-text-secondary leading-relaxed">
        Kolaborasi strategis antara 2 inisiatif Capture The Flag: platform CTF kampus UKM NFCC dan ekosistem CTF open-source NXCTF.
      </p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2 Entity Cards (Compact, Balanced Logos & Official Web Links) -->
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5 items-stretch" data-reveal-group data-reveal-stagger="120">

      <!-- Faction 1: NFCTF (UKM NFCC) -->
      <div data-reveal-child class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-surface/90 border border-white/10 hover:border-nf-orange/40 backdrop-blur-xl motion-card shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4 pb-3.5 border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <img
                src="/nfctf-bgb.png"
                alt="NFCTF Logo"
                class="w-11 h-11 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-xl object-contain bg-black border border-white/10 p-1 shadow-md shrink-0"
              />
              <div>
                <span class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-nf-orange-bright font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-0.5">
                  CTF INTERNAL KAMPUS
                </span>
                <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white leading-tight">
                  NFCTF (UKM NFCC)
                </h3>
                <span class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-text-muted">STT Terpadu Nurul Fikri</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a
              href="https://nfcc.my.id"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-nf-orange-bright hover:underline shrink-0 bg-white/5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-white/10"
            >
              nfcc.my.id ↗
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="text-text-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Divisi dan inisiatif kompetisi resmi <strong>UKM NFCC</strong> di STT Terpadu Nurul Fikri yang berfokus pada pembinaan talenta mahasiswa melalui <strong>2x Workshop (1 Online, 1 Offline)</strong>, mentoring teknis offensive security, dan perancangan challenge CTF.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-center">
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated border border-nf-orange/30 text-nf-orange-bright font-semibold">
            UKM NFCC
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated border border-white/10 text-text-secondary">
            2x Workshop
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated border border-white/10 text-text-secondary">
            Kampus STT-NF
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Faction 2: NXCTF Community -->
      <div data-reveal-child class="p-6 sm:p-7 rounded-2xl bg-surface/90 border border-white/10 hover:border-nx-cyan/40 backdrop-blur-xl motion-card shadow-xl flex flex-col justify-between group">
        <div>
          <div class="flex items-center justify-between gap-3 mb-4 pb-3.5 border-b border-white/5">
            <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
              <img
                src="/nxctf-logo.png"
                alt="NXCTF Logo"
                class="w-11 h-11 sm:w-12 sm:h-12 rounded-xl object-contain bg-black border border-white/10 p-1 shadow-md shrink-0"
              />
              <div>
                <span class="font-mono text-[0.62rem] text-nx-cyan font-bold uppercase tracking-wider block mb-0.5">
                  OPEN SOURCE CTF ECOSYSTEM
                </span>
                <h3 class="font-display font-bold text-lg text-white leading-tight">
                  NXCTF Community
                </h3>
                <span class="font-mono text-[0.7rem] text-text-muted">Platform & Tooling Ecosystem</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <a
              href="https://nxctf.my.id"
              target="_blank"
              rel="noopener noreferrer"
              class="font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-nx-cyan hover:underline shrink-0 bg-white/5 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-lg border border-white/10"
            >
              nxctf.my.id ↗
            </a>
          </div>

          <p class="text-text-secondary text-xs sm:text-sm leading-relaxed mb-5">
            Ekosistem CTF open-source modern yang mengembangkan platform kompetisi, orchestrator challenge, dan menyediakan infrastruktur server resmi NFX CTF 2026 di <strong>ctf.nfx.my.id</strong>.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="grid grid-cols-3 gap-2 pt-3 border-t border-white/5 font-mono text-[0.68rem] text-center">
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated border border-nx-cyan/30 text-nx-cyan font-semibold">
            NXCTF Engine
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated border border-white/10 text-text-secondary">
            Skala Nasional
          </div>
          <div class="p-2 rounded-lg bg-surface-elevated border border-white/10 text-text-secondary">
            Open-Source
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>
